# Feature: Costing

- Rolls up employee time, material, machine, and correction/rework cost per design.
- Compares actual cost against approved estimate/standard; reviews commercial margin.
- Costing Team role can enter development/standard cost entries and review
  margin, but **cannot** mark employee mistakes (that's the Sample Checker /
  Design Head's call via `14-feature-correction.mdc`) and cannot make cost
  master changes belonging to Admin.
- Costing must be complete (per configured mandatory rule) before Final
  Approval can be marked complete - see `15-feature-approval.mdc`.
